NOVA OS development image

This image is an experimental Debian Trixie amd64 live system with KDE Plasma.
It is not a stable release and must be tested in a disposable virtual machine
before installation on real hardware.

The Debian Installer live mode is available from the boot menu. Disk operations
are user initiated; back up all important data before selecting a target disk.

NOVA does not promise universal APK, EXE, MSI, DMG or PKG compatibility.
Read the NOVA compatibility and security documentation before enabling runtime
adapters. The local daemon only reports host capability state and inspects
filename/URL hints; it never executes uploaded or downloaded files.
